age from NPM.\n\n```\nnpm install @truffle/dashboard-message-bus-common\n```\n\n```\nyarn add @truffle/dashboard-message-bus-common\n```\n\n### Adding new message types\n\nRight now there are very few message types. The most important one is `\"provider\"`, which sends RPC requests for the dashboard-provider. Other message types are `\"invalidate\"`, which can be sent to invalidate earlier messages, and `\"log\"`, which is sent by the message bus to send log messages over the wire. The interfaces of these messages are defined inside of this package, from where they can be imported by consumers.\n\nTo add additional message types, the interface for the new message type should be defined in this package under `lib/messages.ts`. To use these new messge formats, support needs to be added to any consuming packages such as `@truffle/dashboard` as well.\n","gitHead":"93f18f7373b74e774e5fa068da3ee3202541f372","scripts":{"build":"tsc","prepare":"yarn build"},"_npmUser":{"name":"gnidan","email":"nick@gnidan.org"},"deprecated":"Package no longer supported. Contact Support at https://www.npmjs.com/support for more info.","repository":{"url":"git+https://github.com/trufflesuite/truffle.git","type":"git","directory":"packages/dashboard-message-bus-common"},"_npmVersion":"lerna/4.0.0/node@v14.19.0+arm64 (darwin)","description":"Message types that are used when communicating with the Truffle dashboard message bus","directories":{"dist":"dist"},"_nodeVersion":"14.19.0","publishConfig":{"access":"public"},"_hasShrinkwrap":false,"readmeFilename":"README.md","devDependencies":{"typescript":"^4.7.4","@types/node":"~12.12.0"},"_npmOperationalInternal":{"tmp":"tmp/dashboard-message-bus-common_0.1.4-hardhat-error.0_1660955944528_0.9174986038735411","host":"s3://npm-registry-packages"}},"0.1.4-hardhat-error.1":{"name":"@truffle/dashboard-message-bus-common","version":"0.1.4-hardhat-error.1","author":{"name":"Rosco Kalis","email":"roscokalis@gmail.com"},"license":"MIT","_id":"@truffle/dashbo